{"id":"1184139488097792001","date":"2019-10-15","url":"https://x.com/bobmcgrewai/status/1184139488097792001","author":"bobmcgrewai","text":"Very excited to share what I and the amazing robotics team at OpenAI have been working on for the last couple of years!","quoted":{"url":"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/1184135128869527552","text":"We've trained an AI system to solve the Rubik's Cube with a human-like robot hand.\n\nThis is an unprecedented level of dexterity for a robot, and is hard even for humans to do.\n\nThe system trains in an imperfect simulation and quickly adapts to reality: https://t.co/O04izt3KvO https://t.co/8lGhU2pPck"},"live_status":200,"archived_at":"20191015163445","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20191015163445/https://twitter.com/bobmcgrewai/status/1184139488097792001","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
